With the help of a recursion call tree, predict the output of the following C program.

```c
#include<stdio.h>

int fn(int i, int p)
{
    if(i==0) return 0;
    else if(i%2) return fn(i/2, 2*p)+p;
    else return fn(i/2, 2*p)-p;
}

int main()
{
    printf("%d", fn(24,1));
    return 0;
}
```

